{"4499300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Sievert Scale", "steam_appid": 4499300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/e18a4a4b625ea94f8dbfb218b0ba886e.avif?t=1774558312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras_big/e18a4a4b625ea94f8dbfb218b0ba886e.webp?t=1774558312 width=1560 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sievert Scale is a surveillance horror game where you work as a newly appointed safety contractor in a UK based nuclear power plant. There is a growing public sentiment against nuclear power, with communities still reeling from Windscale and Chernobyl. Mandatory weekly safety audits are required by law. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail the audit, the plant ceases operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your workstation, switch between live camera feeds across the facility - watch for safety contraventions, unusual behaviour and sinister activity. Capture evidence and report incidents before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.poster.avif?t=1774558312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.webm?t=1774558312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.mp4?t=1774558312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive instructions from management via the internal email network. Beware, protocols can change mid-shift. What matters now may not matter later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/90f44c46c1bc179191b49d148a747894.avif?t=1774558312\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritise carefully - not everything should be reported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standard shift lasts 60 - 90 minutes. Incidents escalate in real time. Stay alert, adapt to changing directives, and don't let anything slip through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas of the facility are not part of your initial assignment. As incidents escalate, new camera feeds may become accessible. What’s happening deeper inside the plant was never meant to be monitored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONITOR PLANT SAFETY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REPORT ALL INCIDENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAILURE TO REPORT CONSTITUTES NEGLIGENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXCESSIVE REPORTING DISRUPTS OPERATIONS</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/e18a4a4b625ea94f8dbfb218b0ba886e.avif?t=1774558312\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras_big/e18a4a4b625ea94f8dbfb218b0ba886e.webp?t=1774558312 width=1560 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sievert Scale is a surveillance horror game where you work as a newly appointed safety contractor in a UK based nuclear power plant. There is a growing public sentiment against nuclear power, with communities still reeling from Windscale and Chernobyl. Mandatory weekly safety audits are required by law. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail the audit, the plant ceases operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your workstation, switch between live camera feeds across the facility - watch for safety contraventions, unusual behaviour and sinister activity. Capture evidence and report incidents before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.poster.avif?t=1774558312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.webm?t=1774558312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/cba80fece68d067edf178c24a863b432.mp4?t=1774558312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive instructions from management via the internal email network. Beware, protocols can change mid-shift. What matters now may not matter later. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/extras/90f44c46c1bc179191b49d148a747894.avif?t=1774558312\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prioritise carefully - not everything should be reported.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standard shift lasts 60 - 90 minutes. Incidents escalate in real time. Stay alert, adapt to changing directives, and don't let anything slip through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some areas of the facility are not part of your initial assignment. As incidents escalate, new camera feeds may become accessible. What’s happening deeper inside the plant was never meant to be monitored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MONITOR PLANT SAFETY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REPORT ALL INCIDENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAILURE TO REPORT CONSTITUTES NEGLIGENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXCESSIVE REPORTING DISRUPTS OPERATIONS</strong></p>", "short_description": "A surveillance horror based inside a nuclear power plant. Monitor CCTV, Identify hazards, document incidents and keep operations running. Report too much and you fail the weekly audit, too little and danger spreads. What’s happening deeper inside the plant was never meant to be monitored.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/7e2b9d1074da1c3d02a60c1fb4e5f8cd0a5101b9/header.jpg?t=1774558312", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/e4a85480079914e8a0878768372d492562f0ed12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774558312", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4499300/e4a85480079914e8a0878768372d492562f0ed12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774558312", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["WensleyDale Studios"], "publishers": ["WensleyDale Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": fa